div data-controller="modal"
  = render partial: "form", locals: { chronicle: @chronicle, form_legend: "Edit chronicle" }
  div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 1rem;"
    = link_to "Open", current_team_chronicle_path(@chronicle), role: "button"
    button type="button" class="secondary" data-action="click->modal#open" style="margin-bottom: 0;"
      | Destroy this chronicle

  dialog data-modal-target="dialog"
    article style="max-width: 650px;"
      header
        button aria-label="Close" rel="prev" data-action="click->modal#close" style="float: right;"
        h4 style="margin-bottom: 0;" Destroy Chronicle
      p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"
        | Are you sure you want to destroy
        strong = @chronicle.name
        | ?
      footer
        div style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; flex-wrap: nowrap;"
          button.secondary type="button" data-action="click->modal#close" style="margin-bottom: 0; white-space: nowrap;"
            | Cancel
          = button_to "Destroy Chronicle Only", current_team_chronicle_path(@chronicle), method: :delete, params: { destroy_orphaned_insights: false }, class: "outline secondary", style: "margin-bottom: 0; white-space: nowrap;"
          = button_to "Destroy & Delete Orphaned Insights", current_team_chronicle_path(@chronicle), method: :delete, params: { destroy_orphaned_insights: true }, class: "contrast", style: "margin-bottom: 0; white-space: nowrap;"
        p style="text-align: right; margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0;"
          small style="color: var(--pico-muted-color);"
            | Insights that are not part of any other memory or chronicle will be permanently deleted.
